'''单侧卵巢发育不全'''（unilateral ovarian agenesis），也称为'''单侧卵巢缺失'''（unilateral ovarian absence, UOA），是一种罕见状况，指个体仅有一侧卵巢而非两侧，且无法用既往[[卵巢切除術|卵巢切除术]]解释。可能的成因包括[[卵巢扭轉|卵巢扭转]]或[[血管阻塞]]导致一侧卵巢缺失，以及真正的发育不全，即卵巢在发育过程中从未形成。单侧卵巢发育不全比无功能性卵巢（{{tsl|en|XX gonadal dysgenesis|XX性腺发育不全}}）更为常见。根据[[马来西亚]]一家医疗机构报告的两例病例（该机构共进行了22,483例妇产科手术），其发生率估计为1/11,241。2023年的一项综述认为，由于单侧卵巢发育不全通常[[无症状]]，且多为[[腹腔鏡手術|腹腔镜手术]]中的{{tsl|en|Incidental medical findings|偶然医学发现|偶然发现}}，因此其发生率可能被低估。该状况对生育能力的影响可能很小，甚至没有影响<ref>{{Cite journal |last=Chen |first=H. Alexander |last2=Grimshaw |first2=Alyssa A. |last3=Taylor-Giorlando |first3=Melissa |last4=Vijayakumar |first4=Pavithra |last5=Li |first5=Dan |last6=Margetts |first6=Miranda |last7=Pelosi |first7=Emanuele |last8=Vash-Margita |first8=Alla |title=Ovarian absence: a systematic literature review and case series report |journal=Journal of Ovarian Research |date=16 January 2023 |volume=16 |issue=1 |page=13 |doi=10.1186/s13048-022-01090-1 |issn=1757-2215 |pmc=9841619 |pmid=36642704 |doi-access=free}}</ref><ref>{{Cite journal |last=Uckuyu |first=Ayla |last2=Ozcimen |first2=Emel E. |last3=Sevinc Ciftci |first3=F. Ceylan |title=Unilateral congenital ovarian and partial tubal absence: Report of four cases with review of the literature |journal=Fertility and Sterility |date=2009 |volume=91 |issue=3 |page=936.e5–936.e8 |doi=10.1016/j.fertnstert.2008.09.022 |pmid=18976994 |doi-access=free}}</ref><ref>{{Cite journal |last=Dare |first=F.O. |last2=Makinde |first2=O.O. |last3=Makinde |first3=O.N. |last4=Odutayo |first4=R. |title=Congenital absence of an ovary in a Nigerian woman |url=https://obgyn.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1016/0020-7292(89)90364-0 |journal=International Journal of Gynecology & Obstetrics |language=en |date=1989 |volume=29 |issue=4 |page=377–378 |doi=10.1016/0020-7292(89)90364-0 |pmid=2571540 |s2cid=12377327 |url-access=subscription |access-date=2026-06-05 |archive-date=2023-07-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230727051027/https://obgyn.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1016/0020-7292(89)90364-0 |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite journal |last=Mylonas |first=I. |last2=Hansch |first2=S. |last3=Markmann |first3=S. |last4=Bolz |first4=M. |last5=Friese |first5=K. |title=Unilateral ovarian agenesis: report of three cases and review of the literature |url=https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s00404-002-0451-z |journal=Archives of Gynecology and Obstetrics |language=en |date=2003 |volume=268 |issue=1 |page=57–60 |doi=10.1007/s00404-002-0451-z |issn=1432-0711 |pmid=12673478 |s2cid=11857691 |url-access=subscription |access-date=2026-06-05 |archive-date=2023-07-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230727051028/https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s00404-002-0451-z |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite journal |last=Tzitzimikas |first=S. |last2=Fragkos |first2=M. |last3=Karavida |first3=A. |last4=Mettler |first4=L. |title=Unilateral ovarian absence |url=https://gynecolsurg.springeropen.com/articles/10.1007/s10397-012-0773-1 |journal=Gynecological Surgery |language=en |date=2013 |volume=10 |issue=1 |page=93–95 |doi=10.1007/s10397-012-0773-1 |issn=1613-2084 |s2cid=1003854 |url-access=subscription |access-date=2026-06-05 |archive-date=2025-04-23 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250423092351/https://gynecolsurg.springeropen.com/articles/10.1007/s10397-012-0773-1 |url-status=live }}</ref>。

