'''淋巴管平滑肌瘤病'''<ref>{{术语在线|term =肺淋巴管平滑肌瘤病 |urlid =47fc223326ae11eeab10b068e6519520 }}</ref>（lymphangioleiomyomatosis，LAM）又称'''淋巴管肌瘤病'''<ref>王路易,徐凯峰.淋巴管肌瘤病进展及死亡风险相关因素[J].Basic & Clinical Medicine, 2024, 44(7).DOI:10.16352/j.issn.1001-6325.2024.07.1044.</ref><ref>强军,宋海乔,高万勤,et al.淋巴管肌瘤病胸腹部临床与CT表现[J].中国医学影像技术, 2009, 25(010):1810-1812.DOI:10.3321/j.issn:1003-3289.2009.10.022.</ref>、'''淋巴管平滑肌增生症'''，是一种罕见、进行性、多系统疾病，多以肺部弥漫性[[局灶性肺积气|囊性病变]]为特征，為弥漫性肺间质疾病。LAM主要累及肺、纵隔淋巴结及腹部淋巴结，进而导致[[肺]]功能丧失（逐渐加重的[[呼吸困难]]）、反复[[气胸]]或[[乳糜胸]]、腹水、间断性咯血、肾{{le|血管平滑肌脂肪瘤|Angiomyolipoma}}（angiomyolipoma）或腹膜后淋巴管肌瘤<ref name="Franz 2001 AmJRespirCritCareMed 661-668">{{cite journal|last1=Franz|first1=DN|last2=Brody|first2=A|last3=Meyer|first3=C|last4=Leonard|first4=J|last5=Chuck|first5=G|last6=Dabora|first6=S|last7=Sethuraman|first7=G|last8=Colby|first8=TV|last9=Kwiatkowski|first9=DJ|last10=McCormack|first10=FX|title=Mutational and radiographic analysis of pulmonary disease consistent with lymphangioleiomyomatosis and micronodular pneumocyte hyperplasia in women with tuberous sclerosis|journal=Am J Respir Crit Care Med|date=2001|volume=164|issue=4|pages=661–668|pmid=11520734|doi=10.1164/ajrccm.164.4.2011025}}</ref><ref name="Ryu 2006 AmJRespirCritCareMed 105-111">{{cite journal|last1=Ryu|first1=JH|last2=Moss|first2=J|last3=Beck|first3=GJ|title=The NHLBI lymphangioleiomyomatosis registry: characteristics of 230 patients at enrollment|journal=Am J Respir Crit Care Med|date=2006|volume=173|issue=1|pages=105–111|doi=10.1164/rccm.200409-1298oc|pmid=16210669|pmc=2662978}}</ref><ref name="Avila 2001 Radiology 415-421">{{cite journal|last1=Avila|first1=NA|last2=Bechtle|first2=J|last3=Dwyer|first3=AJ|title=Lymphangioleiomyomatosis: CT of diurnal variation of lymphangioleiomyomatosis|url=https://archive.org/details/sim_radiology_2001-11_221_2/page/n203|journal=Radiology|date=2001|volume=221| issue=2|pages=415–421|doi=10.1148/radiol.2212001448|pmid=11687685}}</ref><ref name="Avila 2007 Radiology 277-285">{{cite journal|last1=Avila|first1=NA|last2=Dwyer|first2=AJ|last3=Rabel |first3=A |title=Sporadic lymphangioleiomyomatosis and tuberous sclerosis complex with lymphangioleiomyomatosis: comparison of CT features|url=https://archive.org/details/sim_radiology_2007-01_242_1/page/n315|journal=Radiology|date=2007|volume=242 |issue=1|pages=277–285|doi=10.1148/radiol.2421051767|pmid=17105849|pmc=2940246}}</ref>。

LAM被认为是一种具有侵袭性和转移性的低度恶性肿瘤。LAM主要影响女性，尤其是生育期的女性<ref name="McCormack 2008 Chest 507-516">{{cite journal|last1=McCormack FX|first1=FX|title=Lymphangioleiomyomatosis: a clinical update|url=https://archive.org/details/sim_chest_2008-02_133_2/page/507|journal=Chest|date=2008|volume=133|pages=507–516|pmid=18252917|doi=10.1378/chest.07-0898}}</ref>。

