'''柑橘黃龍病'''是[[柑橘属]]和部分[[芸香科]]植物的嚴重疾病<ref>{{cite journal |author1=吴丰年 |coauthors=谢素金，赵雅轩，许鹏彬，李俊杰，肖朝锦，林晓娜，杨少辉，岑伊静，黄剑坚 |title=不同种类寄主对柑橘黄龙病菌侵染能力及虫媒适应性的影响 |journal=环境昆虫学报 |date=2023 |volume=45 |issue=1 |pages=63-72 |url=http://hjkcxb.alljournals.net/ch/reader/view_abstract.aspx?file_no=202301006&flag=1 |accessdate=2024-02-26 |archive-date=2024-02-26 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240226074854/http://hjkcxb.alljournals.net/ch/reader/view_abstract.aspx?file_no=202301006&flag=1 |dead-url=no }}</ref>。由基因體整合進宿主{{le|柑桔木蝨|Diaphorina citri}}共生器官的細胞核、不能培養之{{le|韌皮部桿菌|Candidatus liberibacter}}引起<ref>{{Cite web |url=https://scitechvista.nat.gov.tw/c/sZPJ.htm |title=共生細菌會保護宿主？ |access-date=2018-01-27 |archive-date=2018-01-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180127152034/https://scitechvista.nat.gov.tw/c/sZPJ.htm |dead-url=no }}</ref>，通過木虱在株間傳染。染病樹目先見黃葉，青果，然後逐漸枯萎。此病傳染力強，患株無藥可治<ref>{{cite journal |last1=Grafton-Cardwell |first1=EE |last2=Stelinski |first2=LL |last3=Stansly |first3=PA |title=Biology and management of Asian citrus psyllid, vector of the huanglongbing pathogens. |journal=Annual review of entomology |date=2013 |volume=58 |pages=413-32 |doi=10.1146/annurev-ento-120811-153542 |pmid=23317046}}</ref>，可將果園盡毁。於1929年最先报道於中国广东地区，現時傳遍亞洲、非洲及美洲的多个国家，對各地柑橘類種植皆造成破壞<ref>{{cite journal |last1=Bové |first1=J.M. |title=Huanglongbing: A Destructive, Newly-Emerging, Century-Old Disease of Citrus |journal=Journal of Plant Pathology |date=2006 |volume=88 |issue=1 |pages=7–37 |url=http://www.jstor.org/stable/41998278 |accessdate=2024-02-26 |issn=1125-4653 |archive-date=2024-05-05 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240505142140/https://www.jstor.org/stable/41998278 |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{cite journal |last1=Zheng |first1=Z |last2=Chen |first2=J |last3=Deng |first3=X |title=Historical Perspectives, Management, and Current Research of Citrus HLB in Guangdong Province of China, Where the Disease has been Endemic for Over a Hundred Years. |journal=Phytopathology |date=2018-11 |volume=108 |issue=11 |pages=1224-1236 |doi=10.1094/PHYTO-07-18-0255-IA |pmid=30156499}}</ref>。

黃龍病在各國曾經有不同稱謂。現正式稱為"HuangLongBing"，因中國農業學家[[林孔湘]]最先於1950年代對此病之成因、防治作出科學硑究。

