{{Infobox medical condition (new)|name=X连锁淋巴细胞增生性疾病}}
'''X连锁淋巴细胞增生性疾病'''（X-linked lymphoproliferative disease），又名'''邓肯病'''（Duncan's disease）<ref name="Andrews">{{cite book|author=James, William D.|author2=Berger, Timothy G.|title=Andrews' Diseases of the Skin: clinical Dermatology|url=https://archive.org/details/andrewsdiseaseso0000jame_10ed|publisher=Saunders Elsevier|location=|year=2006|pages=|isbn=0-7216-2921-0|oclc=|doi=|accessdate=|display-authors=etal}}</ref>{{rp|86}}或'''珀蒂洛综合征'''（Purtilo syndrome）<ref>{{Cite web|title=XLP|url=https://ghr.nlm.nih.gov/condition/x-linked-lymphoproliferative-disease|accessdate=2019-09-21|last=Reference|first=Genetics Home|work=Genetics Home Reference|language=en|archive-date=2020-09-19|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200919221254/https://ghr.nlm.nih.gov/condition/x-linked-lymphoproliferative-disease}}</ref>，是一种[[淋巴增生性障碍]]<ref name="Bolognia">{{cite book|author=Rapini, Ronald P.|author2=Bolognia, Jean L.|author3=Jorizzo, Joseph L.|title=Dermatology: 2-Volume Set|publisher=Mosby|location=St. Louis|year=2007|pages=808|isbn=1-4160-2999-0|oclc=|doi=|accessdate=}}</ref>。

患有X连锁淋巴细胞增生性疾病的男孩无法对[[人類疱疹病毒第四型]]病毒（EBV）产生免疫反应<ref name="Robbins">{{cite book|author=Kumar, Vinay|author2=Cotran, Ramzi S.|author3=Robbins, Stanley L.|title=Robbins Basic Pathology|url=https://archive.org/details/robbinsbasicpath0000kuma|edition=7th|publisher=Elsevier|location=Philadelphia|year=2003|pages=[https://archive.org/details/robbinsbasicpath0000kuma/page/n431 418]|isbn=1-4160-2534-0|oclc=|doi=|accessdate=}}</ref>，故常死于骨髓衰竭、不可逆肝炎和恶性淋巴瘤。然而，EBV与X连锁淋巴细胞增生性疾病之间的关系尚未明确<ref name="item14">{{EMedicine|article|987765|Lymphoproliferative Disorders}}</ref>。患者体内产生的{{tsl|en|CD27||CD27}}[[记忆B细胞]]数量不足<ref name="pmid16424938">{{cite journal|title=Selective generation of functional somatically mutated IgM+CD27+, but not Ig isotype-switched, memory B cells in X-linked lymphoproliferative disease|url=https://archive.org/details/sim_journal-of-clinical-investigation_2006-02_116_2/page/322|date=February 2006|journal=J. Clin. Invest.|issue=2|doi=10.1172/JCI25720|volume=116|pages=322–33|pmc=1332028|pmid=16424938|vauthors=Ma CS, Pittaluga S, Avery DT, etal}}</ref>。

由于邓肯一家18名男性有6名死于淋巴细胞增生性疾病，包括暴发性[[傳染性單核白血球增多症]]和[[淋巴瘤]]，故此病又称邓肯病<ref>1.Purtilo DT, Cassel C, Yang JP. Letter: Fatal infectious mononucleosis in familial lymphohistiocytosis. N Engl J Med 1974; 291:736.</ref>。珀蒂洛综合征一名则得名于华盛顿州美国陆军病理学中心病理学家兼免疫学家戴维·西奥多·珀蒂洛（David Theodore Purtilo）博士（1939–1992），于1970年代初发现此病。珀蒂洛是[[明尼蘇達州]][[杜魯斯]]人，在一名患者中发现此病后，便率先展开研究。1980年代后期，珀蒂洛居住于[[內布拉斯加州]][[奥马哈 (内布拉斯加州)|奥马哈]]，于1992年9月28日在佛罗里达去世<ref>{{Cite news|title=David T. Purtilo, 53, a Specialist In Disorders of the Immune System|url=https://www.nytimes.com/1992/10/03/us/david-t-purtilo-53-a-specialist-in-disorders-of-the-immune-system.html|newspaper=The New York Times|date=1992-10-03|accessdate=2019-09-21|issn=0362-4331|language=en-US|first=Wolfgang|last=Saxon|archive-date=2018-01-16|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180116085030/http://www.nytimes.com/1992/10/03/us/david-t-purtilo-53-a-specialist-in-disorders-of-the-immune-system.html}}</ref>。

