'''盲反特朗普症候群'''（[[英語]]︰Trump Derangement Syndrome），或译「'''特朗普精神錯亂症候群'''」，是美國的網絡俚語，指的是一種在缺乏邏輯與合理理據的情況下，無視實際的政策立場或他政府所採取的行動，就盲目批評或討厭[[特朗普]]。<ref name=":0">{{Cite web|title=What is 'Trump Derangement Syndrome' -- and do you have it?|url=https://www.cnn.com/2018/07/19/politics/trump-derangement-syndrome/index.html|access-date=2022-01-13|last=Editor-at-large|first=Analysis by Chris Cillizza, CNN|work=CNN|archive-date=2021-02-16|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210216094345/https://www.cnn.com/2018/07/19/politics/trump-derangement-syndrome/index.html|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref name=":1">{{Cite web|title=【新聞教室】連網絡俚語詞典都收錄 何謂「盲反特朗普症候群」？|url=https://www.hk01.com/環球趣聞/213330/新聞教室-連網絡俚語詞典都收錄-何謂-盲反特朗普症候群|access-date=2022-01-13|date=2018-07-20|last=成依華|work=香港01|language=zh-HK|archive-date=2022-01-13|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220113141406/https://www.hk01.com/%E7%92%B0%E7%90%83%E8%B6%A3%E8%81%9E/213330/%E6%96%B0%E8%81%9E%E6%95%99%E5%AE%A4-%E9%80%A3%E7%B6%B2%E7%B5%A1%E4%BF%9A%E8%AA%9E%E8%A9%9E%E5%85%B8%E9%83%BD%E6%94%B6%E9%8C%84-%E4%BD%95%E8%AC%82-%E7%9B%B2%E5%8F%8D%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E7%97%87%E5%80%99%E7%BE%A4|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=特朗普：2019年將是奇妙一年 偉大事情正發生|url=https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/finance/20190101/bkn-20190101212347041-0101_00842_001.html|access-date=2022-01-13|date=2019-01-01|work=on.cc東網|language=zh-hk|archive-date=2022-01-13|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220113141434/https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/finance/20190101/bkn-20190101212347041-0101_00842_001.html|dead-url=no}}</ref>有記者使用這個詞彙來呼籲同業，在判斷特朗普的言論和行動時要保持理性克制。<ref name="#1">{{Cite news|title=Opinion {{!}} Liberals have to avoid Trump Derangement Syndrome|url=https://www.washingtonpost.com/opinions/liberals-have-to-avoid-trump-derangement-syndrome/2017/04/13/81ff4a7a-2083-11e7-a0a7-8b2a45e3dc84_story.html|newspaper=Washington Post|date=2017-04-13|accessdate=2022-01-13|issn=0190-8286|language=en-US|first=Fareed|last=Zakaria|archive-date=2020-10-31|archive-url=https://