'''法布瑞氏病'''<ref>{{樂詞網|term =Fabry氏病 |urlid =d88a0e5f6aae6774845efbbd84f7329e }}</ref>（{{lang|en|Fabry disease}}，{{lang|en|Fabry's disease}}，{{lang|en|Anderson-Fabry disease}}）又称'''-{zh-cn:法布瑞病;zh-tw:法布里病}-'''，是一种[[X连锁]]隐性遗传的[[溶酶体贮积病]]，由于GLA基因突变致使细胞溶酶体内[[鞘糖脂]]代谢异常且累积<ref>{{cite book |doi=10.1016/B978-0-444-62702-5.00017-2 |pmid=26564084 |chapter=Fabry disease |title=Neurocutaneous Syndromes |volume=132 |pages=231–248 |series=Handbook of Clinical Neurology |year=2015 | vauthors = Schiffmann R |isbn=9780444627025 }}</ref><ref>{{Cite book|title=Andrews' Diseases of the Skin E-Book: Clinical Dermatology|url=https://books.google.com/books/about/?id=Np6cCQAAQBAJ|publisher=Elsevier Health Sciences|date=2015-04-12|isbn=978-0-323-31969-0|language=en|first=William D.|last=James|first2=Dirk|last2=Elston|first3=Timothy|last3=Berger |ref=harv}}</ref>。它的命名來自於它的發現者之一，[[喬納斯·法布瑞]]<ref>{{cite journal |vauthors=Fabry J |title=Ein Beitrag zur Kenntniss der Purpura haemorrhagica nodularis (Purpura papulosa haemorrhagica Hebrae) |trans-title=A contribution to the knowledge of the purpura haemorrhagica nodularis (purpura papulosa haemorrhagica Hebrae) |language=de |journal=Archiv für Dermatologie und Syphilis |date=December 1898 |volume=43 |issue=1 |pages=187–200 |doi=10.1007/bf01986897 |doi-broken-date=13 August 2024 |s2cid=33956139 |url=https://zenodo.org/record/2215206 |access-date=2024-09-04 |archive-date=2022-01-25 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220125193151/https://zenodo.org/record/2215206 |dead-url=no }}</ref>（Johannes Fabry）。

==病因==
此病體內負責製造α-galactosidase（a-GAL）酵素的基因缺陷，造成體內[[醣神經胺醇脂質]]（glycosphingolipid）無法代謝，不斷堆積在[[細胞質]]及[[溶體]]中，而引發多處器官病變，且引起机体内一系列脏器的[[缺血性损害]]，嚴重時可能造成死亡<ref>{{cite journal | vauthors = Germain DP | title = Fabry disease | journal = Orphanet Journal of Rare Diseases | volume = 5 | issue = 1 | pages = 30 | date = November 2010 | pmid = 21092187 | pmc = 3009617 | doi = 10.1186/1750-1172-5-30 | doi-access = free }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|url=https://rarediseases.info.nih.gov/diseases/6400/fabry-disease|title=Fabry disease {{!}} Genetic and Rare Diseases Information Center (GARD) – an NCATS Program|website=rarediseases.info.nih.gov|language=en|access-date=17 April 2018|archive-date=2018-04-18|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180418032331/https://rarediseases.info.nih.gov/diseases/6400/fabry-disease|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite journal | vauthors = Perrot A, Osterziel KJ, Beck M, Dietz R, Kampmann C | title = Fabry disease: focus on cardiac manifestations and molecular mechanisms | journal = Herz | volume = 27 | issue = 7 | pages = 699–702 | date = November 2002 | pmid = 12439642 | doi = 10.1007/s00059-002-2429-9 | s2cid = 25962218 }}</ref>。

==症狀==
此病的臨床症狀多變。患者在兒童或青年期，手腳末端會產生間歇性的疼痛或感覺異常，有些患者形容如火燒般劇痛，在高溫、季節變化、及運動後容易產生<ref>{{cite journal | vauthors = Hoffmann B, Beck M, Sunder-Plassmann G, Borsini W, Ricci R, Mehta A | title = Nature and prevalence of pain in Fabry disease and its response to enzyme replacement therapy--a retrospective analysis from the Fabry Outcome Survey | journal = The Clinical Journal of Pain | volume = 23 | issue = 6 | pages = 535–542 | date = July 2007 | pmid = 17575495 | doi = 10.1097/AJP.0b013e318074c986 | s2cid = 36215895 }}</ref>。經常被誤診為[[风湿|風濕病]]，[[關節炎]]，[[關節痛]]，[[生長痛]]或是[[心因性疼痛]]。

==治療方式==
[[File:Fabrazyme - Alfagalaktozydaza Beta.jpg|thumb|法布拉酶（阿加糖酶β）主要用于法布里病的长期酶替代治疗。]]
'''酵素替代療法'''

酵素替代療法旨在補充患者因基因功能障礙而缺失的酵素。這種療法並非根治法布瑞氏症的方法，但可以延緩病情進展<ref>{{Cite journal |last=Wanner |first=Christoph |last2=Arad |first2=Michael |last3=Baron |first3=Ralf |last4=Burlina |first4=Alessandro |last5=Elliott |first5=Perry M. |last6=Feldt-Rasmussen |first6=Ulla |last7=Fomin |first7=Victor V. |last8=Germain |first8=Dominique P. |last9=Hughes |first9=Derralynn A. |last10=Jovanovic |first10=Ana |last11=Kantola |first11=Ilkka |title=European expert consensus statement on therapeutic goals in Fabry disease |url=https://linkinghub.elsevier.com/retrieve/pii/S1096719218301872 |journal=Molecular Genetics and Metabolism |language=en |date=2018-07 |volume=124 |issue=3 |doi=10.1016/j.ymgme.2018.06.004 |access-date=2026-01-12}}</ref>，並可能逆轉部分症狀。截至 2022 年 3 月，已有三種酵素替代療法的藥物可用於治療法布瑞氏症 :

·   Agalsidase alfa，由武田製藥（Takeda）以商品名Replagal銷售，是一種重組的 α-galactosidase <ref>{{cite journal |vauthors=Keating GM |title=Agalsidase alfa: a review of its use in the management of Fabry disease |journal=BioDrugs |date=October 2012 |volume=26 |issue=5 |pages=335–354 |doi=10.2165/11209690-000000000-00000 |pmid=22946754}}</ref>。它於2001年在歐盟獲得批准<ref name=":0">{{Cite web |title=Human medicines European public assessment report (EPAR): Replagal, agalsidase alfa, Date of authorisation: 03/08/2001, Revision: 30, Status: Authorised {{!}} European Federation of Internal Medicine |url=https://efim.org/node/148151 |website=efim.org |access-date=2026-01-12}}</ref>。曾申請美國食品藥物管理局（FDA）核准該藥物<ref>{{Cite news |title=With A Life-Saving Medicine In Short Supply, Patients Want Patent Broken |url=https://www.npr.org/sections/health-shots/2010/08/04/128973687/with-a-life-saving-medicine-in-short-supply-patients-want-patent-broken |last=Knox |first=Richard |work=NPR |date=2010-08-04 |language=en |access-date=2026-01-12}}</ref>。然而，其在美國食品藥物管理局的申請於2012年撤回了，理由是FDA要求在批准前進行額外的臨床試驗<ref>{{Cite web |title=Article > Shire withdraws Replagal in USA as FDA wants more trials |url=http://www.pharmatimes.com/article/12-03-15/Shire_withdraws_Replagal_in_USA_as_FDA_wants_more_trials.aspx |website=www.pharmatimes.com |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140819130944/http://www.pharmatimes.com/article/12-03-15/Shire_withdraws_Replagal_in_USA_as_FDA_wants_more_trials.aspx |archive-date=2014-08-19 |access-date=2026-01-12}}</ref>。截至2022年3月，Replagal尚未獲得FDA批准<ref>{{Cite news |title=Replagal (agalsidase alfa): What is it and is it FDA approved? - Drugs.com |url=https://www.drugs.com/history/replagal.html |work=Drugs.com |language=en-US |access-date=2026-01-12 |archive-url=http://web.archive.org/web/20250820171151/https://www.drugs.com/history/replagal.html |archive-date=2025-08-20}}</ref>。 

·    Agalsidase beta, 是賽諾菲公司 (Sanofi) 以商品名稱 Fabrazyme 銷售的另一種重組alpha-galactosidase。與Replagal一樣，它於2001年獲得歐盟批准 <ref name=":1">{{Cite web |title=Fabrazyme {{!}} European Medicines Agency (EMA) |url=https://www.ema.europa.eu/en/medicines/human/EPAR/fabrazyme |website=European Medicines Agency (EMA) |language=en |archive-url=http://web.archive.org/web/20250821191002/https://www.ema.europa.eu/en/medicines/human/EPAR/fabrazyme |archive-date=2025-08-21 |access-date=2026-01-12}}</ref> 。2003年，它成為首個獲得美國食品藥物管理局（FDA）批准的法布瑞氏症治療藥物<ref>{{Cite web |title=Drug Approval Package: FABRAZYME (AGALSIDASE BETA) |url=https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/nda/2003/103979_toc.cfm |website=www.accessdata.fda.gov |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210331084914/https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/nda/2003/103979_toc.cfm |archive-date=2021-03-31 |access-date=2026-01-12}}</ref> 。 

·    Pegunigalsidase alfa（Elfabrio）是第三種治療法布瑞氏症的酵素替代療法，於2023年5月在歐盟獲準用於治療法布瑞氏症用途 <ref>{{Cite web |title=Elfabrio {{!}} European Medicines Agency (EMA) |url=https://www.ema.europa.eu/en/medicines/human/EPAR/elfabrio |website=European Medicines Agency (EMA) |language=en |archive-url=http://web.archive.org/web/20250629215250/https://www.ema.europa.eu/en/medicines/human/EPAR/elfabrio |archive-date=2025-06-29 |access-date=2026-01-12}}</ref> 。

臨床上，Agalsidase alfa 和 Agalsidase beta在療效和安全性方面相似 <ref>{{Cite journal |last=Arends |first=Maarten |last2=Biegstraaten |first2=Marieke |last3=Wanner |first3=Christoph |last4=Sirrs |first4=Sandra |last5=Mehta |first5=Atul |last6=Elliott |first6=Perry M. |last7=Oder |first7=Daniel |last8=Watkinson |first8=Oliver T. |last9=Bichet |first9=Daniel G. |last10=Khan |first10=Aneal |last11=Iwanochko |first11=Mark |title=Agalsidase alfa versus agalsidase beta for the treatment of Fabry disease: an international cohort study |url=https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5931248/ |journal=Journal of Medical Genetics |date=2018-05 |volume=55 |issue=5 |doi=10.1136/jmedgenet-2017-104863 |issn=1468-6244 |pmc=5931248 |pmid=29437868 |access-date=2026-01-12}}</ref>，但從未在隨機試驗中直接比較它們 <ref>{{Cite web |title=ClinicalTrials.gov |url=https://clinicaltrials.gov/search?intr=replagal%20AND%20fabrazyme&aggFilters=studyType:int&viewType=Table |website=clinicaltrials.gov |access-date=2026-01-12}}</ref>。兩者均以每兩週以靜脈輸注給藥 <ref name=":0" /><ref name=":1" />。

'''藥物伴護療法'''

藥物伴護療法是另一種方法去維持 α-galactosidase 酵素的活性。即使存在導致法布瑞氏症的突變，藥物伴護療法透過輔助 α-galactosidase 的正確折疊來發揮作用。截至2022年3月，有一種藥物伴護療法的藥物可用於治療法布瑞氏症：

·    Migalastat，由Amicus Therapeutics公司以商品名Galafold銷售，是一種藥物伴護小分子，能夠穩定多種 α-galactosidase 突變體。它是一種口服藥物。在一項比較 Migalastat 與酵素替代療法的隨機試驗中，兩種療法的療效和安全性相似<ref>{{Cite journal |last=Hughes |first=Derralynn A. |last2=Nicholls |first2=Kathleen |last3=Shankar |first3=Suma P. |last4=Sunder-Plassmann |first4=Gere |last5=Koeller |first5=David |last6=Nedd |first6=Khan |last7=Vockley |first7=Gerard |last8=Hamazaki |first8=Takashi |last9=Lachmann |first9=Robin |last10=Ohashi |first10=Toya |last11=Olivotto |first11=Iacopo |title=Oral pharmacological chaperone migalastat compared with enzyme replacement therapy in Fabry disease: 18-month results from the randomised phase III ATTRACT study |url=https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5502308/ |journal=Journal of Medical Genetics |date=2017-04 |volume=54 |issue=4 |doi=10.1136/jmedgenet-2016-104178 |issn=1468-6244 |pmc=5502308 |pmid=27834756 |access-date=2026-01-12}}</ref>。 美國食品藥物管理局（FDA）於2004年授予Galafold孤兒藥資格 <ref>{{Cite web |title="Migalastat Orphan Drug Designations and Approvals". U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA). Retrieved 16 September 2020. |url=https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/opdlisting/oopd/detailedIndex.cfm?cfgridkey=180003}}</ref>，歐盟委員會於2006年也授予了該資格<ref>{{Cite web |title=EU/3/06/368 - orphan designation for treatment of Fabry disease {{!}} European Medicines Agency (EMA) |url=https://www.ema.europa.eu/en/medicines/human/orphan-designations/eu-3-06-368 |website=www.ema.europa.eu |date=2009-05-15 |language=en |access-date=2026-01-12}}</ref> 。 歐洲藥品管理局人用藥品委員會（CHMP）於2016年5月核准該藥以Galafold為商品名上市 <ref>{{Cite web |title=Amicus Therapeutics Announces European Commission Approval for Galafold™ (Migalastat) in Patients with Fabry Disease in European Union |url=https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2016/05/31/844646/15991/en/Amicus-Therapeutics-Announces-European-Commission-Approval-for-Galafold-Migalastat-in-Patients-with-Fabry-Disease-in-European-Union.html |website=GlobeNewswire News Room |date=2016-05-31 |language=en-us |last=Inc |first=Amicus Therapeutics |access-date=2026-01-12}}</ref><ref>{{Cite journal |title=Human medicines European public assessment report (EPAR):  Galafold, migalastat, Fabry Disease, Date of authorisation: 25/05/2016, Revision: 9, Status: Authorised |url=https://doi.org/10.31525/cmr-58722f |journal=Case Medical Research |date=2019-04-29 |doi=10.31525/cmr-58722f |issn=2643-4652 |access-date=2026-01-12}}</ref>。 美國食品藥物管理局（FDA）於2018年核准了此藥 <ref>{{Cite web |title=Drug Approval Package: Galafold (migalastat) |url=https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/nda/2018/208623Orig1s000TOC.cfm |website=www.accessdata.fda.gov |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210403132158/https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/nda/2018/208623Orig1s000TOC.cfm |archive-date=2021-04-03 |access-date=2026-01-12}}</ref>。 

