[[File:Nissan_LEAF_got_thirsty.jpg|缩略图|[[日产聆风]] 拥有117km续航 （[[美国国家环境保护局|EPA]]标准）。]]
'''里程焦虑'''（{{langx|en|'''Range anxiety'''}}）是指车主或驾车人认为车辆没有足够的续航以抵达其目的地，对其在路途中抛锚的担心。<ref name="RSC">{{Cite web|title=Sustainable transportation based on electric vehicle concepts: a brief overview|url=https://www.researchgate.net/publication/224880220_Sustainable_transportation_based_on_electric_vehicle_concepts_a_brief_overview|author=Eberle|first=Ulrich|publisher=[[Royal Society of Chemistry]]|date=2010-05-14|accessdate=2010-06-08|archive-date=2013-10-21|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20131021070726/http://www.researchgate.net/publication/224880220_Sustainable_transportation_based_on_electric_vehicle_concepts_a_brief_overview|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|url=http://www.cpuc.ca.gov/NR/rdonlyres/8B8F7624-1DF1-426B-847A-74255D3484D6/0/SCE_Comments_on_LDV_Electrification_White_Paper.pdf|title=Comments of Southern California Edison Company on the California Public Utilities Commission Staff’s White Paper, Light-Duty V|author=Backstrom|first=Michael|date=May 22, 2009|accessdate=26 June 2010|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20100629060851/http://www.cpuc.ca.gov/NR/rdonlyres/8B8F7624-1DF1-426B-847A-74255D3484D6/0/SCE_Comments_on_LDV_Electrification_White_Paper.pdf|archivedate=29 June 2010}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news|url=http://schott.blogs.nytimes.com/2009/01/15/range-anxiety/|title=Range Anxiety|date=January 15, 2009<!--, 4:29 pm-->|accessdate=26 June 2010|work=The New York Times|first=Ben|author=Schott|archive-date=2019-09-30|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190930233305/https://schott.blogs.nytimes.com/2009/01/15/range-anxiety/}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news|url=https://www.nytimes.com/cwire/2010/05/07/07climatewire-will-lithium-air-battery-rescue-electric-car-37498.html|title=Will Lithium-Air Battery Rescue Electric Car Drivers From 'Range Anxiety'?|date=May 7, 2010|accessdate=26 June 2010|work=The New York Times|first=Saqib|author=Rahim|archive-date=2017-09-19|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170919220416/http://www.nytimes.com/cwire/2010/05/07/07climatewire-will-lithium-air-battery-rescue-electric-car-37498.html}}</ref> 里程焦虑主要发生在[[純電動車|纯电动汽车]]上 ，这也被认为大规模推行[[电动汽车]]的一大障碍。<ref name="RSC" /><ref name="harv1">{{Cite web|url=http://www.innovations.harvard.edu/cache/documents/11089/1108934.pdf|title=Policy options for electric vehicle charging infrastructure in C40 cities|author=Jose Gomez-Ibane|work=Clinton Climate Initiative|publisher=Harvard|accessdate=23 July 2010|archive-date=2014-01-10|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140110122536/http://www.innovations.harvard.edu/cache/documents/11089/1108934.pdf}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news|url=http://www.foxnews.com/leisure/2010/09/16/elecric-car-juice-pray-angel/|title=Electric Car Out of Juice? Pray for an Angel|author=Gordon-Bloomfield|first=Nikki|date=16 September 2001|publisher=TheCarConnection.com|accessdate=23 September 2010|archive-date=2016-12-20|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20161220235537/http://www.foxnews.com/leisure/2010/09/16/elecric-car-juice-pray-angel/}}</ref> 里程焦虑一词首先出现在1997年《San Diego Business Journal》的一篇文章中，用于形容 GM EV1 司机的一种担忧。<ref name="SDBJ">{{Cite web|title=First public citation of range anxiety|url=http://www.wordspy.com/words/rangeanxiety.asp|access-date=2019-04-30|archive-date=2014-08-09|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140809062102/http://www.wordspy.com/words/rangeanxiety.asp}}</ref> 2010年6月，[[通用汽车|通用汽车公司]]对“里程焦虑”一词提出商标申请，并声称此举基于“促进公众对电动车辆能力的认知”。<ref>{{Cite web |url=http://jalopnik.com/5626306/how-gm-will-use-fear-to-sell-you-a-chevy-volt |title=存档副本 |access-date=2019-04-30 |archive-date=2018-11-16 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20181116074820/https://jalopnik.com/5626306/how-gm-will-use-fear-to-sell-you-a-chevy-volt }}</ref>  本词的[[挪威语]]版本{{lang|no|''rekkeviddeangst''}} 被挪威语言理事会选为2013年“年度词汇”第二名。<ref>{{Cite web|url=http://insideevs.com/range-anxiety-in-2nd-place-on-norways-words-of-the-year-list/|title="Range Anxiety" in 2nd Place on Norway’s "Words of the Year" List|publisher=Inside EVs|author=Eric Loveday|access-date=2019-04-30|archive-date=2017-08-15|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170815222107/http://insideevs.com/range-anxiety-in-2nd-place-on-norways-words-of-the-year-list}}</ref><ref>[http://www.sprakrad.no/Toppmeny/Aktuelt/Arets-ord-sakte-tv/ Årets ord: sakte-tv] {{Wayback|url=http://www.sprakrad.no/Toppmeny/Aktuelt/Arets-ord-sakte-tv/ |date=20150317153232 }} (in Norwegian) via Quartz, [http://qz.com/159595/norway-electric-cars/ Norway is starting to have more electric cars than it can handle] {{Wayback|url=http://qz.com/159595/norway-electric-cars/ |date=20140824043627 }}.</ref>

减轻电动汽车司机里程焦虑的主要策略有部署更广泛的[[充电桩|充电设施]]，在不过分提高价格的情况下提高[[电池#電池容量|电池容量]]， 发展换电技术，加装增程器（[[輔助動力系統|APU]] 的一种）。也包括提供更精确导航和续航里程预测以及提供免费备用汽车以支持长距离旅行。

