{{Infobox medical condition (new)|name=脊髓性肌萎缩伴进行性肌阵挛性癫痫|synonyms=Jankovic-Rivera综合征|image=Autosomal recessive - en.svg|caption=此种病症为常染色体隐性遗传病|field=神经病学}}
'''脊髓性肌萎缩伴进行性肌阵挛性癫痫'''（spinal muscular atrophy with progressive myoclonic epilepsy，SMA-PME），有时也称'''Jankovic-Rivera综合征'''（Jankovic–Rivera syndrome），是一种非常罕见的[[神經退化障礙|神经退行性疾病]]，症状包括缓慢进行性肌肉萎缩，主要影响远侧肌肉，伴有{{tsl|en|denervation|失神经支配}}和[[肌阵挛]][[癲癇發作|發作]]<ref>{{Cite journal|title=Spinal Muscular Atrophy with Progressive Myoclonic Epilepsy: Report of New Cases and Review of the Literature|first1=G.|last2=Chattopadhyay|first2=A.|journal=Neuropediatrics|issue=6|doi=10.1055/s-2002-37087|year=2002|volume=33|pages=314–319|pmc=|pmid=12571787|last3=Skorodis|first3=L.|last4=Manzur|first4=A.|last5=Mercuri|first5=E.|last6=Talim|first6=B.|last7=Akçören|first7=Z.|last8=Renda|first8=Y.|last9=Muntoni|first9=F.|last1=Haliloglu|last10=Topaloğlu|first10=H.}}</ref>。科学文献仅载有12个家族患有SMA-PME<ref name=":0">{{Cite web|title=Spinal muscular atrophy with progressive myoclonic epilepsy|url=https://ghr.nlm.nih.gov/condition/spinal-muscular-atrophy-with-progressive-myoclonic-epilepsy#genes|last=Reference|first=Genetics Home|language=en|website=Genetics Home Reference|access-date=2018-09-24|archive-date=2020-10-01|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201001140104/https://ghr.nlm.nih.gov/condition/spinal-muscular-atrophy-with-progressive-myoclonic-epilepsy#genes|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

SMA-PME与ASAH1[[基因]]的[[外显子]]2[[錯義突變]]（c.125C→T）或[[刪除 (遺傳學)|刪除]]有关，为常染色体隐性遗传<ref>{{Cite journal|title=Spinal Muscular Atrophy Associated with Progressive Myoclonic Epilepsy is Caused by Mutations in ASAH1|url=https://archive.org/details/sim_american-journal-of-human-genetics_2012-07-13_91_1/page/4|first1=J.|last2=Tawk|first2=M.|journal=The American Journal of Human Genetics|issue=1|doi=10.1016/j.ajhg.2012.05.001|year=2012|volume=91|pages=5–14|pmc=3397266|pmid=22703880|last3=Tiziano|first3=F. D.|last4=Veillet|first4=J.|last5=Bayes|first5=M.|last6=Nolent|first6=F.|last7=Garcia|first7=V.|last8=Servidei|first8=S.|last9=Bertini|first9=E.|last1=Zhou|last10=Castro-Giner|first10=F.|last11=Renda|first11=Y.|last12=Carpentier|first12=S. P.|last13=Andrieu-Abadie|first13=N.|last14=Gut|first14=I.|last15=Levade|first15=T.|last16=Topaloglu|first16=H.|last17=Melki|first17=J.}}</ref>。SMA-PME与一种名为法伯脂肪肉芽肿病的溶酶体疾病密切相关<ref>{{Cite journal|title=Acid ceramidase deficiency associated with spinal muscular atrophy with progressive myoclonic epilepsy|first1=Joanna J.|last2=Garcia|first2=Virginie|date=2015-12-01|journal=Neuromuscular Disorders|issue=12|doi=10.1016/j.nmd.2015.09.007|volume=25|pages=959–963|language=en|issn=0960-8966|pmid=26526000|last3=Tian|first3=Jane|last4=Tagliati|first4=Michele|last5=Parisi|first5=Joseph E.|last6=Chung|first6=Jeffrey M.|last7=Lewis|first7=Richard|last8=Baloh|first8=Robert|last9=Levade|first9=Thierry|last1=Gan|last10=Pierson|first10=Tyler Mark}}</ref>。与许多遗传紊乱疾病一样，SMA-PME尚无治愈方法。

美国研究者Joseph Jankovic和Victor M. Rivera在1979年首次描述了这种病症<ref>{{Cite journal|title=Hereditary myoclonus and progressive distal muscular atrophy|url=https://archive.org/details/sim_annals-of-neurology_1979-09_6_3/page/227|first1=J.|last2=Rivera|first2=V. M.|journal=Annals of Neurology|issue=3|doi=10.1002/ana.410060309|year=1979|volume=6|pages=227–231|pmc=|pmid=534421|last1=Jankovic}}</ref>。

== ASAH1基因 ==
ASAH1基因编码溶酶体中的酸性神经酰胺酶。溶酶体分解酸性神经酰胺酶，然后利用脂肪酸成分<ref>{{Cite journal|title=Acid ceramidase and human disease|last=Park|first=Jae-Ho|last2=Schuchman|first2=Edward H.|date=December 2006|journal=Biochimica et Biophysica Acta|issue=12|doi=10.1016/j.bbamem.2006.08.019|volume=1758|pages=2133–2138|issn=0006-3002|pmid=17064658}}</ref>产生髓磷脂。髓磷脂围绕在机体神经周围，有助于信号在神经细胞间的传递，并提高传输速率<ref>{{Cite journal|title=The Myelin Sheath|url=https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK27954/|last=Morell|first=Pierre|last2=Quarles|first2=Richard H.|date=1999|journal=Basic Neurochemistry: Molecular, Cellular and Medical Aspects. 6th Edition|language=en|access-date=2019-09-21|archive-date=2020-11-11|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201111223416/https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK27954/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。SMA-PME患者体内神经酰胺酶功能减弱三分之二<ref name=":0" />。酸性神经酰胺酶分解缺乏导致髓磷脂缺乏，进而导致神经细胞损伤。

